ByteSplit and Split16 Bloom filter attribution

include/byte_split_bloom.h and rust/src/byte_split.rs adapt the mask construction
from FastFilter/fastfilter_cpp's SimdBlockFilterFixed16:
https://github.com/FastFilter/fastfilter_cpp/blob/7c5bf187d5096ccbcec6a16e02975d0af3328b01/src/bloom/simd-block-fixed-fpp.h

