Modifications in this repository: direct power-of-two bucket addressing;
64-byte-aligned storage grouping four 16-byte buckets; portable scalar mask;
native C++/Rust batch and single-query APIs; cache-line partitioned parallel
construction and read-only query support. The signed 16-bit high multiplication
and byte-shuffle mask mapping, including zero-mask lanes, is preserved.

This notice documents the attribution of the adapted implementation. It is not
an assertion that the ByteSplit layout is an unmodified upstream filter.

include/split16_bloom.h adapts the eight-u16-sector mask from the same pinned
header's AArch64 SimdBlockFilterFixed, with the same copyright, Apache-2.0
license and upstream Impala attribution. It uses direct power-of-two bucket
addressing, typed owned storage, a scalar fallback, bounded bulk prefetch and
partitioned parallel construction. It is not the x86 Fixed16 byte mask.
